2	// residual/iterations/view-live-editing-plan.md — "Cleanup + wiring +
3	// integration"). Pure orchestration glue over already-tested modules: reads
4	// the embedded snapshot, holds the single `PendingState` in a module-level
5	// closure, and wires every mount*/regenerate* function together via a
6	// shared `onChange` callback so any interaction from any module keeps the
7	// matrix rows and staged-commands textarea in sync.
8	//
9	// No business logic lives here — see model.ts/actions.ts/render-decisions.ts
10	// for state transitions and validation, and each mount*'s own header comment
11	// for its DOM contract. Not unit-tested on its own (see the task's explicit
12	// note that this file is an accepted exception to the repo's normal TDD
13	// requirement — there is no meaningful unit to red/green here beyond what
14	// the modules it wires already cover).
