17	// src/view/shell.html, after `<main>` and after the embedded snapshot
18	// `<script>` block — every element this file queries already exists in the
19	// DOM by the time this module executes, so no `DOMContentLoaded` wrapper is
20	// needed (mirrors the previous inline `<script>` this replaces).
